OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fwith the cloud often well broken,
OL,7,Fclear skies at times, but cloudier
OL,8,Fover Caithenss and eastern Sutherland.
OL,9,FA little patchy rain could push
OL,10,Fthrough Lochaber and the Uists later
OL,11,Fin the night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,14,Fwith warm hazy sunshine. Cloudier
OL,15,Fskies at times across Caithness with
OL,16,Fshowery rain possible through
OL,17,FLochaber, Skye and the Uists later in
OL,18,Fthe day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
