OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith some bright spells Thursday
OL,7,Fmorning, some rain or showers in the
OL,8,Feast later. Unsettled and cloudy
OL,9,FFriday and Saturday with occasional
OL,10,Frain or showers developing. Winds
OL,11,Fmostly light.
